    {
        "content": "<p>Let me thank <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"439483\">@Andrew Yang</span> for the incredible job to prove case 2 of the main result, including Kummer's lemma (and of course all the other contributors!).</p>\n<p><a href=\"#narrow/stream/113488-general/topic/Completion.20of.20the.20FLT.20regular.20project\">Thread</a> for further discussion.</p>",
